摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Visual plugin marketplace for DeepSeek Harness — browse, search and install community plugins","id":"gh:1334161261","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"zat-dsh-engine","slug":"mishibeikejie/zat-dsh-engine","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Visual plugin marketplace for DeepSeek Harness — browse, search and install community plugins"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Zat-DSH Engine"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> The visual plugin marketplace for DeepSeek Harness. Browse, search, install, update and uninstall "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"community plugins — Wallpaper Engine style."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 中文说明"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Zat-DSH Engine adds a **Plugin Market** tab to **Settings → Plugins** in the DeepSeek Harness web GU"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"I. It lists the entire `dsh-plugin` topic community from GitHub, shows bilingual intros, and install"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"s plugins with one click."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Full community catalog** — live GitHub search of the `dsh-plugin` topic (1700+ repositories, gro"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"wing daily)\n- **AI plugin finder** — in any conversation just say what you need (e.g. \"find me a plu"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"gin that lets the model see images\") and the AI searches the market, recommends candidates, and repo"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"rts each one's **pre-install health + security scan** (✅/⚠️/❌) — problems are reported honestly, not"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"hing is blindly recommended\n- **12 categories** — Theme, Tools, Browser, Skills, Vision, Network, Ag"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"ents, Data, Hardware, Design, Security…\n- **Live search** — type to filter, no Enter key needed; cle"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"aring the box returns to the full list\n- **Bilingual intros** — 999 pre-translated Chinese intros bu"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"ndled; new plugins keep their English intro (on-the-fly model translation is removed — with peak/off"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"-peak pricing, mass-translating on store open could burn your balance); English UI shows the origina"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"l GitHub description\n- **Install / Update / Uninstall** — one click, powered by the official `dsh pl"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"ugin` profile mechanism (`pnpm` under the hood)\n- **Monorepo-aware install** — repositories that bun"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"dle several plugins install correctly: a single-plugin repo installs silently, multi-plugin repos of"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"fer a plain-language picker\n- **Installed detection** — marks plugins you already have, with version"},{"id":"p7s14","text":" comparison and an **update badge** when a newer version is released\n- **Cross-platform** — full Win"},{"id":"p7s15","text":"dows and Linux support (PowerShell / sh, curl / wget, system-proxy aware)\n- **Network auto-adaptatio"},{"id":"p7s16","text":"n** — inherits your VPN/system proxy for fetching and installing; if GitHub is unreachable, requests"},{"id":"p7s17","text":" automatically fall back to `gh-proxy.com` and recover. **Works without a VPN**: proxy → direct → mi"},{"id":"p7s18","text":"rror → built-in fetch fallback\n- **One-click enable/disable** — toggle plugins right on the card (of"},{"id":"p7s19","text":"ficial core and the market itself are protected)\n- **Pre-install conflict gate + 🩺 health check** — "},{"id":"p7s20","text":"blocking two marketplaces at once, official-package hijack, duplicate patch rows / registered names;"},{"id":"p7s21","text":" one-click health report on conflicts and dependency issues\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"> ⚠️ **Install it with the command below — do NOT hand-edit any patch file.**\n> Letting an AI \"insta"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ll\" this project by pasting the repo URL and manually editing `cordis.patch.yml` breaks dsh: the mar"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ket's own `plugin-market` row is auto-mounted by dsh from the bundled patch, and writing it by hand "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"into two places (`app.asar.unpacked/cordis.patch.yml` and `~/.dsh/profiles/<profile>/cordis.patch.ym"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"l`) duplicates the id and makes dsh fail to start. If dsh already won't start, delete the hand-writt"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"en `plugin-market` row from your profile's `cordis.patch.yml` and reinstall with the command below."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### From GitHub (recommended, after release)"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### From China without a VPN (via the domestic mirror, verified)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Either command installs the same plugin. Once installed, the market's own search and install paths c"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"arry the mirror fallback, so networking is handled for you."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### From a local checkout"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### From npm (if published later)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Replace `web` with your profile name if you use a different one (`headless` etc.)."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> Requirements: a working dsh installation, `pnpm` and `curl` on PATH, and a profile that has been i"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"nitialized (`dsh plugin --profile web add` creates it on first use)."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"1. Restart dsh after installing.\n2. Open the web GUI → **Settings → Plugins**.\n3. Click the **🛒 Plug"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"in Market** tab on the right of the plugin list.\n4. Browse, search, filter by category or install st"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ate, and click **Install** on any card.\n5. Restart dsh to activate installed plugins."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Update"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Re-running `add` updates to the latest commit. The marketplace also detects its own updates and show"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"s an **Update** button beside the title."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Permissions & trust (security-review perspective)"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"This marketplace is at heart a **package manager**, and that job itself requires strong capabilities"},{"id":"p29s2","text":". A security review will always see the behaviors below — here is what each one is for and where its"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"iew will always see the behaviors below — here is what each one is for and where its boundaries are:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- **Running shell commands**: install/update/uninstall means running pnpm. The market only runs the "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"pnpm/curl/wget/powershell commands it assembles itself; during install, pnpm runs the plugin's own p"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"repare/postinstall scripts (standard behavior for every package manager) — the market scans those sc"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ripts first and warns ahead of time about network downloads or high-risk patterns.\n- **Reading git c"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"redentials**: used in exactly two places — starring a repo and the \"set GitHub token\" feature. Crede"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"ntials only go to api.github.com; they are never written to disk, logged, or sent anywhere else.\n- *"},{"id":"p30s7","text":"*The gh-proxy.com mirror**: only as a fallback when a direct GitHub request fails, and only for publ"},{"id":"p30s8","text":"ic repository metadata. A plugin's own network behavior after install has nothing to do with the mir"},{"id":"p30s9","text":"ror.\n- **Reading/writing profile files**: install/uninstall/toggle must edit the profile's package.j"},{"id":"p30s10","text":"son etc. Every change is backed up to `zat-backup/` first, and failed operations restore automatical"},{"id":"p30s11","text":"ly.\n- **Pre-install health + security scan**: every candidate and every installed plugin is scanned "},{"id":"p30s12","text":"for structural, dependency, and security patterns (obfuscation, credential theft, suspicious exfiltr"},{"id":"p30s13","text":"ation, system modification), with all network destinations listed before install; security findings "},{"id":"p30s14","text":"only warn (never block), while objective issues like missing entries or unsupported OS are blocked."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Each of these is the minimal permission set required for the market to work; if a review questions a"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" specific behavior, this section is the reference."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
